  "content": "<p>一個增加新盔甲、工具、新維度和生物等的模組，所有內容均以紫水晶、銅、翡翠、石英、冰、泥土、黑曜石、黏土或原始礦物（如端礦）等素材製作，旨在創造更有趣和全新的體驗<br>以及全新體驗<br><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alex-armor/settings/aa\" alt=\"\"> 這裡是所有物品<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1239/336/310/172/capture-decran-2025-07-02-132632.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1239/339/310/172/capture-decran-2025-07-02-132642.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1239/340/310/172/capture-decran-2025-07-02-132652.png\"><br>.<br><br></p>\n<p>這裡是所有新的紫水晶方塊</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1145/677/310/172/capture-decran-2025-03-29-213511.png\">.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這裡是新盔甲</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1239/335/310/172/capture-decran-2025-07-02-133348.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;還有新傳送門</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1239/334/310/172/capture-decran-2025-07-02-133855.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果你想看到更多關於此模組的畫面，可以前往圖片頁查看</p>",
